HEADS AA

START ** CONS ** SU

CONS #_ CONS *X RR
CONS #! CONS ** RR
CONS =_ CONS *X RR
CONS =! CONS ** RR
CONS |* REW *| LL
CONS _* RESET ** US

RESET #X RESET ** US
RESET XX CLEAN1 ** DS

CLEAN1 _X CLEAN2 ** US
CLEAN1 !X CLEAN2 ** SS
CLEAN2 *X CLEAN2 ** RR
CLEAN2 *| REW1 *X LL

REW1 =* REW1 ** LL
REW1 #* SHORT ** SS

REW =* REW ** LL
REW #* CONS ** DS

REWIND =* REWIND ** LL
REWIND _* REWIND ** LL
REWIND |* REWIND ** LL
REWIND #* SHORT ** DS

SHORT _* TERMINATE ** SS
SHORT #* SHORT ** RR
SHORT =X SHORT ** RR
SHORT |X REWIND ** SS
SHORT =| TRUNC |* RR
SHORT || REWIND ** SS

TRUNC |* TRUNC _* RR
TRUNC =* TRUNC _* RR 
TRUNC _* REWIND ** RR

TERMINATE *! TERMINATE *_ RR
TERMINATE *_ STOP ** SS